    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"feature\"><em>Trigger:</em> The [[lookup @name lowercase]] is hit by an attack roll.</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Response:</em> The [[lookup @name lowercase]] halves the attack’s damage to itself (round down), and it teleports to an unoccupied space it can see within [[lookup @range.value activity=f6zHSW2bzTmUO9oR]] feet of itself.</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Constitution Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=f6zHSW2bzTmUO9oR]], each creature within [[lookup @target.template.size activity=f6zHSW2bzTmUO9oR]] feet of the [[lookup @name lowercase]]'s destination space.</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Failure</em>: The target has the &amp;Reference[Poisoned apply=false] condition until the end of its next turn. While Poisoned, it has the &amp;Reference[Incapacitated apply=false] condition.</p>",
